    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "Halcom is recorded as narrow at 163 staff, with its own payments and e-signature products as the only stack on file. Both facts point the same way: a small firm organised around a specific product line.\n\nOwning products is the pattern that repeatedly counts against leads in this set, because a firm's own application occupies the layer a partnership would need. Combined with a narrow footprint and a small bench, there is little in the record to build a case on. Priority 4, needs OSS screen.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**4 \u00b7 needs OSS screen**\n- Halcom (SI)\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> Narrow. 163 staff.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:30:00.367099Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:30:00.367104Z"
    }
